            },
            "description": "Supported index symbols: NIFTY50 | INDIAVIX | SENSEX | NIFTY500 | NIFTY_BANK | NIFTY_IT | NIFTY_AUTO | NIFTY_PHARMA | NIFTY_FMCG | NIFTY_METAL | NIFTY_REALTY | NIFTY_MEDIA | NIFTY_ENERGY | NIFTY_INFRA | NIFTY_HEALTHCARE | NIFTY_FIN_SERVICES | NIFTY_PRIVATE_BANK | NIFTY_PSU_BANK | NIFTY_COMMODITIES | NIFTY_OIL_GAS | NIFTY_FIN_SERVICES_2550 | GIFT_NIFTY | FII_DII"
